<title>HONG KONG: Mingly Corp interim net surges 76.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Mingly Corp interim net surges 76.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.5    vs  11.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.5     vs  2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    388.8   vs  219.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,238.1 vs  1,573.9</p>
<p>    Company name		 The Mingly Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 16-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Mingly Corp has interests in property development and management, hotel services and cloth dyeing and printing.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
